flowchart TB
    accTitle: Implemented Pi-to-R path
    accDescr: Pi starts a persistent R endpoint separately from generic manifested calls made through fresh DuckDB clients and ducknng.
    PI["Pi agent"] --> PLACE["persistent_r_start()"]
    PI --> RPC["ducknng_describe() / ducknng_call()"]
    PLACE -->|"starts; returns URL"| NANO["nanonext REP endpoint"]
    RPC --> API["@duckdb/node-api"]
    API --> DB["fresh DuckDB client"]
    DB --> DNNG["vendored ducknng"]
    DNNG <-->|"NNG framed RPC"| NANO
    NANO --> R["persistent mirai R process"]
